WEBVTT

00:32:25.333 --> 00:32:30.268
that you can pretty much have more agency
about from the beginning to the end,

00:32:30.292 --> 00:32:31.559
I sit with that.

00:32:31.583 --> 00:32:33.309
And even me, I have nothing to say.

00:32:33.333 --> 00:32:35.809
I just take it in and I say,
"Wow, that's a moment."

00:32:35.833 --> 00:32:38.059
AG: OK, how long do I have to sit?

00:32:38.083 --> 00:32:39.351
EP: You know what it is?

00:32:39.375 --> 00:32:42.351
You sit, you suddenly say,
and then I watch to see,

00:32:42.375 --> 00:32:45.875
and generally what happens is that
that's the moment that people swallow.

00:32:46.792 --> 00:32:48.518
You know, it's the quiver here.

00:32:48.542 --> 00:32:51.476
It's the moment,
it is that vulnerability moment,

00:32:51.500 --> 00:32:54.226
but it is a moment of insight and change.

00:32:54.250 --> 00:32:56.434
And then from there, whatever happens,

00:32:56.458 --> 00:32:58.726
either it disappears
and it just was a thought,

00:32:58.750 --> 00:33:01.875
either it becomes the ground
of a new enterprise